<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:f63f370353b015f6052eaf620f7fda75641598d82baafd4fc0c16d168b5b6b45> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:3ec00a24e3072978d4e8a1a97fcb6c281caff08b083c8893531c4475607872aa> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:f63f370353b015f6052eaf620f7fda75641598d82baafd4fc0c16d168b5b6b45> <https://example.org/slice/text> "1. The outer reefs lie a half day north of the landing, and they show\nthemselves only at the lowest tide, when the water draws off the shelf." .
