<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:263018a4a00ecf99c2609f17333c04bfe00deb9408b649c9c009ae93730a51c9> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:3ec00a24e3072978d4e8a1a97fcb6c281caff08b083c8893531c4475607872aa> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:263018a4a00ecf99c2609f17333c04bfe00deb9408b649c9c009ae93730a51c9> <https://example.org/slice/text> "2. Count the heads from the west: the Anvil, the Comb, the Long Tooth,\nand the four the chart marks with a dotted line and with no name at all." .
