<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:82710bbb2b959864d15d162b85c77ead0709d0aaacd01283b1c7f2aaac9d6dc4> <https://example.org/slice/ordinal> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:82710bbb2b959864d15d162b85c77ead0709d0aaacd01283b1c7f2aaac9d6dc4> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:a374153e1feb7b41fc5ffc0f43e3f9584811904bf10cc1c7764de8d615f3bd87> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:82710bbb2b959864d15d162b85c77ead0709d0aaacd01283b1c7f2aaac9d6dc4> <https://example.org/slice/text> "4. The lagoon is warm to the depth of an arm, and it keeps the colour\nof weak tea until the afternoon wind turns it the colour of slate." .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:82710bbb2b959864d15d162b85c77ead0709d0aaacd01283b1c7f2aaac9d6dc4> <https://example.org/slice/verse> "4"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
