<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:16215b8587cbc9572bb342a908507783468491023502fb91a912f0a6273fecca> <https://example.org/slice/text> "5. The shell middens on the south bar are older than the landing, and\nno survey has counted them; the café on the quay sells the smaller ones\nto visitors, which is one reason the count keeps falling every season." .
