<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:0153776a353855d8b1eb942fd7d59420cee8f83a0db20d01abb77000fb15b61c> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:87368167a426dd5cc2ef8b8a491959e6adf4369981f30946b79d692eda226b9a> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:0153776a353855d8b1eb942fd7d59420cee8f83a0db20d01abb77000fb15b61c> <https://example.org/slice/text> "The salt pans open west of the lagoon and dry white by midsummer. Walk\nthem at first light, when the crust still carries a person, and mark\nthe pans you cross so the next surveyor can retrace the same ground.\nA bed worth a second visit carries a 🐚 in the margin of the sheet." .
