<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:287ad0fa03ae2884dcf32718b1ffe9304ac52057340dd1ae9bb7f3b9011ed40a> <https://example.org/slice/text> "The marker stone at the head of the pans carries the character 中, cut\nby a surveyor whose notebook has never been found." .
