<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:1cf15fd3a454a2bffd4d7982bc822e179fcc2e9fbfe5d317758399dc67ac8299> <https://example.org/slice/ordinal> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:1cf15fd3a454a2bffd4d7982bc822e179fcc2e9fbfe5d317758399dc67ac8299> <https://example.org/slice/section> <https://example.org/slice/section:sha256:44393d9ddecf005cb0ab0f9045fb69004ecb08e7748449d57b9b254b9dd2fc29> .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:1cf15fd3a454a2bffd4d7982bc822e179fcc2e9fbfe5d317758399dc67ac8299> <https://example.org/slice/text> "6. The spring tide arrives two days after the new moon and lifts the\nwater over the outer bar by the height of a hand." .
